    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατανίζω</span></b>  (pres.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-νίπτω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Ph.
			2.45
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash well</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄξει πάντα κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ulc.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν κηρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					13.743
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλακι κατανενιμμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					108.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wash out, purge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ διάρροιαι . . -νιφθεῖσαι πεπαύσονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					2.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατανίζεται τὸ σῶμα τοῖς
			οἴνοις</span> Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.484a
			</span></i>.</div>
